- configurable rubric (weighted dimensions), threshold gate, named hard checks

- circuit breaker: force accept best draft after max_iterations consecutive failures

- per-round JSONL review records for auditing (records_dir)

- domain-agnostic: ideation_default() preset + generic usage example

- 19 unit tests incl. breaker path, records, non-research rubric
